    {
      "key": "support.faq.play.q",
      "en": "How do I play?",
      "zh_Hant": "要怎麼玩？"
    },
    {
      "key": "support.faq.play.a",
      "en": "Move matching goods onto the same shelf. When three identical items are visible together, they clear. Complete the board before time runs out.",
      "zh_Hant": "將相同商品移到同一個貨架。當三個相同商品同時出現在貨架上，就會消除。在時間用完前，清空所有商品即可過關。"
    },
    {
      "key": "support.faq.contact.q",
      "en": "How do I contact support?",
      "zh_Hant": "如何聯絡客服？"
    },
    {
      "key": "support.faq.contact.a",
      "en": "Email us at %s. Include a short description, your device platform, and when the problem happened.",
      "zh_Hant": "請寄電子郵件至 %s，簡短說明問題、裝置平台及問題發生的時間。"
    },
    {
      "key": "support.faq.contact.action",
      "en": "Email Support",
      "zh_Hant": "寄信給客服"
    },
    {
      "key": "support.faq.crash.q",
      "en": "What if the game freezes or crashes?",
      "zh_Hant": "遊戲卡住或閃退時該怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "key": "support.faq.crash.a",
      "en": "Close and reopen the game first. If it happens again, restart the device and make sure the game is updated. Contact support with the device model, platform version, and what you were doing before the problem.",
      "zh_Hant": "請先關閉並重新開啟遊戲。如果再次發生，請重新啟動裝置，並確認遊戲已更新。聯絡客服時，請提供裝置型號、平台版本，以及問題發生前你正在進行的操作。"
    },
    {
      "key": "support.faq.sync.q",
      "en": "How do I sync progress between devices?",
      "zh_Hant": "如何在不同裝置間同步進度？"
    },
    {
      "key": "support.faq.sync.a",
      "en": "Use the same signed-in platform account on both devices and allow synchronization to finish before playing. If the progress differs, avoid playing on both devices and contact support.",
      "zh_Hant": "請在兩台裝置上登入同一個平台帳號，並等同步完成後再開始遊戲。如果進度不同，請先不要在任一裝置上繼續遊玩，並聯絡客服。"
    },
    {
      "key": "support.faq.bad_ad.q",
      "en": "How do I report a bad ad?",
      "zh_Hant": "如何檢舉不當廣告？"
    },
    {
      "key": "support.faq.bad_ad.a",
      "en": "1. Close the ad if you can do so safely.\n2. Take a screenshot of the ad and any advertiser or app name shown.\n3. Note the approximate time and where the ad appeared in the game.\n4. Describe why the ad seemed offensive, misleading, or fraudulent.\n5. Email these details to %s. Do not include passwords or payment information.",
      "zh_Hant": "1. 如果能安全關閉廣告，請先關閉。\n2. 擷取廣告畫面，以及畫面中顯示的廣告主或應用程式名稱。\n3. 記下大約時間，以及廣告在遊戲中出現的位置。\n4. 說明你認為廣告含有冒犯、誤導或詐騙內容的原因。\n5. 將上述資訊寄至 %s。請勿附上密碼或付款資訊。"
    },
